cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Fractional Thermal Control in Embedded Systems: book repository"
abstract: >-
  Companion repository of the book "Fractional Thermal Control in Embedded
  Systems: Build, Measure and Regulate a Low-Cost Thermoelectric Experiment"
  (Springer Nature). Reference firmware, virtual plant, digital-twin monitor,
  build-step prompts and figure scripts for a low-cost Peltier experiment:
  instrumentation, PID/FOPID control, adaptive supervision, state observer and
  dew-point condensation.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ferrer Pareja"
    given-names: "Miguel F."
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-7518-3583"
    affiliation: "University of Las Palmas de Gran Canaria"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-11"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ThermalProjects/Fractional-Thermal-Control"
keywords:
  - fractional-order control
  - FOPID
  - Peltier
  - thermoelectric cooler
  - instrumentation
  - monitoring
  - digital twin
  - state observer
  - dew point
  - Arduino
